  "description": "The SNOMED CT codes on the hub's Condition nodes, with the ICD-10 codes the graph pairs them with ((:SnomedConcept)-[:STANDARD_CONCEPT]->(:ICD10Code) and (:Condition)-[:CODED_BY]->(:ICD10Code)). Read from the local graph on 2026-11-25 with the query below; scripts/nedrex/import_nedrex.py matches each code to a NeDRex disorder (#1167).",
